==Battleground==
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>, delay 6~12 seconds<sup>180f~360f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 76.67 seconds<sup>2,300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Archer (Enemy)|Archer]] spawns as the boss.
**20 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
**1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns.
**1 [[One Horn]] spawns.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

